              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-5435",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-5435\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: libc6\nFixed Version: \nLink: [CVE-2026-5435](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-5435)\nThe deprecated functions ns_printrrf, ns_printrr and fp_nquery in the GNU C Library version 2.2 and newer fail to enforce the caller-supplied buffer length, and can result in an out-of-bounds write when printing TSIG records.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-5435**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|libc6||[CVE-2026-5435](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-5435)|\n\nThe deprecated functions ns_printrrf, ns_printrr and fp_nquery in the GNU C Library version 2.2 and newer fail to enforce the caller-supplied buffer length, and can result in an out-of-bounds write when printing TSIG records."
              },
              "properties": {
